            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="about-beyond reveal">
            <h3>Beyond the screen</h3>
            <p>
              When I'm not coding, you'll probably find me watching anime,
              following sports, or falling down some random rabbit hole. ☺︎
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="about-photo reveal" aria-hidden="true">
          <img src="/images/profile.png" alt="A photo of me" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <Projects />

    <section id="contact" class="page-section contact-section">
      <p class="section-label">03 — SAY HELLO</p>
      <h2 class="reveal">/ let's connect</h2>

      <div class="contact-content" reveal>
        <div class="contact-intro reveal">
          <h3>Have something in mind?</h3>
          <h3 class="contact-highlight">Let's talk.</h3>

          <p>
            Whether you have a project in mind or just want to chat about tech,
            my inbox is always open.
          </p>

          <div class="contact-options">
            <p>
              <span class="contact-option-title"
                >✦ Open for Collaborations:</span
              >
              Technical projects, open-source initiatives, and hackathons.
            </p>

            <p>
              <span class="contact-option-title"
                >✦ Work &amp; Opportunities:</span
              >
              Freelance builds, engineering roles, and exciting team endeavors.
            </p>

            <p>
              <span class="contact-option-title"
                >✦ Good Tech Conversations:</span
              >
              Always up to discuss software architecture, emerging tools, or new ideas.
            </p>
          </div>

          <p class="contact-closing">Whatever it is, feel free to reach out!</p>

          <a href="mailto:sakshidb.dev@gmail.com" class="say-hi-button">
            <svg
              xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
              width="18"
              height="18"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="2"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
              aria-hidden="true"
            >
              <rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="14" rx="2"></rect>
              <path d="m3 7 9 6 9-6"></path>
            </svg>
            <span>Get in Touch</span>
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="contact-visual reveal" aria-hidden="true">
          <span class="contact-orbit orbit-one"></span>
          <span class="contact-orbit orbit-two"></span>
          <span class="contact-star">✦</span>
          <span class="contact-dot"></span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <a
        href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/sakshi-db/"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="linkedin-card reveal"
      >
        <div class="linkedin-card-icon">in</div>

        <div class="linkedin-card-text">
          <h3>Want to know more about my journey?</h3>
          <p>Find me on LinkedIn and follow along.</p>
        </div>

        <span class="linkedin-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
      </a>

      <Blob />
      <Feedback />
      <FloatingBlob />
    </section>

    <footer class="site-footer">
      <div class="footer-bottom">
        <p>© 2026 sakshidb. All rights reserved.</p>
        <p>Made with ‪‪❤︎‬ & curiosity ✦ by Sakshi Bhosale</p>
      </div>
    </footer>
  </main>
</Layout>

<script>
  const prefersReducedMotion = window.matchMedia(
    "(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)",
  ).matches;

  if (!prefersReducedMotion) {
    document.documentElement.classList.add("js-reveal");

    const revealElements = document.querySelectorAll(".reveal");

    if ("IntersectionObserver" in window) {
      const observer = new IntersectionObserver(
        (entries, observer) => {
          entries.forEach((entry) => {
            if (entry.isIntersecting) {
              entry.target.classList.add("is-visible");
              observer.unobserve(entry.target);
            }
          });
        },
        {
          threshold: 0.12,
          rootMargin: "0px 0px -40px 0px",
        },
      );

      revealElements.forEach((element) => observer.observe(element));
    } else {
      revealElements.forEach((element) => element.classList.add("is-visible"));
    }
  }
</script>
